{"server":"tw","storyId":"act31side_level_act31side_03_beg","groupId":"act31side","stageId":"act31side_03","title":"早芒種","storyCode":"HS-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"5d914309610cff0580b8de7f3312441814456af9149c6152a17b8f19d3736ab5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"年和夕因突然回到大荒城的兄長而感到不安。禾生和小滿在田間遇到了一個自稱久未歸鄉的商人。商人大方表示，可以賣給兩人一個“願望”。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"姐姐。\n我跟著那位先生遠走，才發現原來外面的天地和這大荒城大不相同。我們留在這裡短短幾十年，人類又琢磨出不少新奇玩意。\n炎國大地上還有各式各樣的城市，除了望不到頭的農田，還有華麗的宮殿，熱鬧的集市，樣樣有趣。\n我回來歇歇就走。這一趟還是出遠門，不知道多少年才能回來。\n說起來，這大荒城也不是早些年艱苦的時候，能照料這片田地的人多得是，你真的不打算跟我一起出去看看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……姐姐，我發現，原來外面的大地與這大荒城也沒有什麼不同。\n是啊。又走了幾十年，還是百來年？想法總是會變的。\n見得多了，發現原來不論走到哪裡，人到底只是人，這人間好像沒什麼意思……人心叵測，但其實也不難猜。\n嗯。先生死前說的話，我吃透了。\n姐姐……你還打算留在這裡多久？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cottage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼好不容易把你從那座山頭揪出來，還是這麼自閉？既然現在黍也不在，和我出去轉轉囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒什麼新奇玩意，但是果蔬糧食的味道還真是移動城市的種植地塊比不了的。對了，你是不是還從來沒見過糧食是怎麼釀成酒的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"心煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天師府是不是又來找你麻煩了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怕天師府什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……有這功夫，你應該為外面一動不動的大傢伙想想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天師們都去救災了，我一個人能有什麼辦法，又不能親自上手……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好無聊啊！還是讓我看看，你今天畫的是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼小氣嘛，沒靈感的話我還能給你出出主意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我，出去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g5_factory_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼緊張？看來是真的有秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是秘密，是煩心事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……天師府裡的老傢伙們是挺煩的，但其實奈何不了你什麼。而且都有朝廷替我們打包票了，他們最多嘮叨你幾句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你在煩……“他”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感覺到他已經到了，從不隱瞞的。我們怎麼說也是一家人，不去看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼生疏啊……我聽說他每次經過你的山頭，都會帶些搜羅來的當世最好的畫作送你的，你可別嘴硬說你不喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你上次見他，是什麼時候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，還真記不清了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他手中的生意做得太大，被司歲台提醒了好幾次，之後好像收斂了一點。最近幾年就只是遊山玩水，把炎國每座城市都挨個轉了個遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可司歲台盯他比盯我們要嚴密得多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道得這麼清楚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和司歲台打交道的時候，偷偷瞄了兩眼他們的記事本——藏得沒那麼深的那部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“生意做得太大”。我怎麼記得，他不過只是個喜歡養蠶種桑，跟在黍身邊的小呆子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近一次見他的時候——就是你所謂的“路過”那時——我從畫裡探過一兩眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那眼神，渾，討厭，和那個——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——和臭棋簍子一樣，我懂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且臭棋簍子越獄那年，他人就在百灶。你以為這幾年大炎對你我不聞不問，都主要盯著誰呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得他們勾搭上了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不曉得。我還以為臭棋簍子只和令姐大哥關係好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但要是司歲台做下了這種判斷，他也不可能像現在這樣到處串門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又不是不知道他有多會做“人”，年年定期給司歲台上交的帳本，每一筆生意、每一文的收支都記得明明白白，挑不出半點毛病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論哪裡的城市遇上天災受了損失，他自掏腰包賑災的速度比誰都快。就是看在這一點上，司歲台再怎麼說也得留幾分情面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得他有幾分好心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底也是我們的兄弟……我還能背後說他壞話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種事你少幹了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況人間本就不存在我們這樣的關係。“兄弟姐妹”……我倒是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滾。別湊過來。也別趁機偷看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，別動手，別急。唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“兄弟姐妹”。畢竟世俗意義上的骨肉親情對我們來說並不成立……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能幾百年後，炎國的史官會特別發明一個詞來形容我們這樣的關係……或許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你這嘴硬的彆扭性子要是能改改，我們還能多搞幾次家庭聚會來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼時候嘴硬過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，你什麼時候才願意讓我看看，你書房裡的那十二幅畫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……滾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒錯，是十二幅。哪怕是三姐消失後，你也一直留著她那一幅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——畫上的那些人究竟是誰，想明白了嗎？還是不願意再想了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總不能……連你的自畫像……至今都還是無從下筆吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年","speakerId":"avgnew_2014_nian_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非要這麼扭扭捏捏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g1_desertedcityfield_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"一場暴雨。\n天上的灰雲已經散了，空氣中還能聞到濕潤的氣味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"左樂看到禾生咬了咬牙，按下了手中天師儀的開關。\n緊接著，一種他沒有見過的大型載具碾過田地，一排排的莊稼跟著倒了下去。\n風刮過斷了根而枯黃的闊大的葉，發出止不住的響聲。像是傲慢的嗤笑——\n災害說來就來，說走就走。\n人能奈這片天如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些作物就是要放棄了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片地是我的第一塊試驗田，原本種的都是玉米。它們全都被含源石的污水浸過了，只能處理掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一塊地一旦被源石污染過，恢復起來異常困難。所以這片大地很遼闊，但是能用來耕作的土地卻少之又少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉米連芯子都是甜的，我小時候剛來大荒城第一次嚐，覺得它是最好吃的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想讓它好好地長在土裡，讓所有人都能嚐到它的甜味，像我第一次吃時那樣開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"發動機聲隆隆作響，只留下一片光禿禿的土地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾——終於找到你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走快走，工程他們軋了一片田，職農大叔和天師們吵起來了，你快去看看吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g1_desertedcityfield_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，災害剛過，物資短缺，時間緊任務重，我們的工程耽誤不起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些田已經是決定要廢棄了，各位就讓條道，讓我們把這些工具搬過去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“廢”？兩嘴唇一碰就開始胡說！這裡種田的天師前兩天才告訴過我，莊稼研究到了最關鍵的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們開著載具直接從我們田上碾過去，誰給你們的權力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“丁卯號地塊泥土樣本檢測到過量源石顆粒濃度”，這個意思就是說這片田已經被污染了，已經廢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的災年年都有，怎麼你們這些外面的人來了，這土地在你們嘴裡就成了廢地了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這田地又沒辦法挪，幾場災下來已經被污染了，不救田也是上面的決定……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今年已經是荒年，不救田可是要鬧荒的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是不是沒見過早些年大批大批餓死人的時候？！輕飄飄一句話，說先工程就先工程，不僅不幫著救土地還軋了過去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大荒城可是我們的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你說的這都是什麼道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老天爺的道理！我去你的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的土木天師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我去你的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去你的！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔阿姨們，你們別打架啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王伯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這田……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看！這地剛被源石毀過一次，還沒來得及救，他們這些人開著載具又來軋一次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一說話就搬出什麼侍郎什麼報告，誰認你那個侍郎？那人我見都沒見過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位天師，我們似乎並沒有收到任何有關廢棄這片田地的通知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得之前應該已經決定了，優先搶救土地……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還沒有聽說？工程物資的補給已經到位了。大荒城的改建昨天晚上就恢復動工了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據最新的土地受損檢查結果，也重新評估了修復土地所需的成本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得出的結論是，要放棄大荒城外圍農田地塊的改建，優先保障核心城的建設……而且，要做好隨時移動核心城的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前土地的污染源研究清楚了嗎？為什麼急著下這樣的判斷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天師府……更上層得出的結論。你要是不信，也可以去找資深天師確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"禾生回過頭看了看，幾位職農無助望著被履帶碾過的田壟，神色黯然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾位前輩，如果最終天師府得出了要放棄田地的結論，我們都會聽從安排的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是這些田，不僅是這裡的大家工作的地方，也是人們的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然還沒有正式通知大家搬離。至少現在，懇請你們先把這些工程器械挪到別的地方去，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好，我答應你。不過也就這幾天的時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你們年年守在這裡耕種是辛苦，但是情況不一樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去沒有移動城市的時候，人們確實離不開這片地，可是現在的莊稼都搬上移動地塊發展無土栽培了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，大荒城這片地也沒有什麼特殊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"土木天師","speakerId":"avg_npc_1246_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說要在這裡研究有源石耐受性的莊稼，可是這麼多年過去了，不也沒什麼結果嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g11_shuresearchoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不確定……如果最後只能得到這個結果，“萬頃”這項研究，根本沒有推廣應用的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這麼多年了，別說成果，一點希望的苗頭都看不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g1_desertedcityfield_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤憤不平的職農","speakerId":"avg_npc_1249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾，你和那些人說了什麼，他們就走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也沒什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"王伯……最近，大家還是把握時間收拾田地吧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"47_g3_fieldpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大水牛？大水牛！你到底在發什麼呆啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在要怎麼辦？聽那些天師的意思，大荒城真的要搬走？這些田都要拋下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鄉長奶奶不知道在哪裡，我們要不要去找她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你說話啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果大荒城有這樣的變動，她應該是第一個知道的。她沒有站出來，說明她也沒有辦法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我更沒有辦法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又說什麼喪氣話呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，當年的神農，會不會真的是個神仙啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然的話，她是怎麼能在這麼艱苦的環境裡，開闢出這麼一片土地的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神農是很厲害，可是現在的人們能把這片土地照顧好也很厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是隨隨便便就說放棄了，神農才要狠狠罵你呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小滿感覺腳下踩到了什麼東西，慌慌張張收回了腳。稻穀晃了晃，一個人影直起身子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾下午睡的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，擾人清夢啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正夢到稻穀豐收，突然一場天災，生生把這場好夢給砸醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀！你這人怎麼在田裡睡覺啊，不怕別人踩到你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是已經狠狠地踩到我了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那還不是因為你躺錯地方了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉！這位先生，您沒有傷到哪裡吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傷倒是沒傷，可是這好好的衣服上踩了這麼大一個泥腳印，實在是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明是你……睡覺不看地方的大叔叔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……走路不看路的小丫頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小滿……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你說怎麼辦嘛！我幫你洗乾淨，還是賠你一件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，我身上的物件都是走南闖北搜羅來的最精貴的東西，交給你洗，最後只會收到一團亂麻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生……您就是為大荒城帶來救災物資的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是機靈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是個商人，早些年做生意存下了一些本錢，聽聞大荒城遇上了災害就趕了回來，故鄉有難，自然是要盡己所能幫一幫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是大荒城的人？你為什麼會在田地裡睡覺？你在這裡沒有家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太久沒有回來，這裡風景都變了模樣，沒想到就迷了路……正好想問問，你們知道看影子戲的地方怎麼走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“影子戲”？那是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用秸稈編出花樣，用布蒙著燈，照出花樣的影子演戲"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你們現在已經不看影子戲了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒看到過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，你們如今慶祝豐收的地方在哪呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說大戲台嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我知道，你順著這條路走，看到第三棵大樹，再左轉就是啦，其實就在神農祠的後面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……神農祠倒是還在。不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝，你是第一個願意給我指路的人，也算和你有緣。賣你一個願望，什麼都行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人伸出手，掌心躺著一枚圓潤的石子，盈盈地搖晃著光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個願望，什麼都行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"願望？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不信，你是商人，又不是神仙，難道我跟你說了，它就真能實現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的確只是一個商人，不過生意做得大一點，什麼都能買，什麼都能賣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但能跟我做生意的機會不是人人都有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真的？"},{"type":"narration","text":"小滿回頭看了一眼站在身後的小禾，仔細想了想，又看回面前的男人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我希望……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我希望大荒城年年豐收，歲歲平安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，這個願望我賣給你了，那對應的，你要拿什麼來買呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小滿……這個人看起來很奇怪，我們還是走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有什麼值錢的東西，你可別想騙我的錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不用多麼貴重，只要是你喜歡的、看重的物件，都可以拿來交換。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾！我可以吹那首曲子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曲子？……哪首曲子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"小滿一噘嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你真是個笨水牛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處，幾隻羽獸停在牧獸的背上，用它們長長的喙捉走牧獸身上的小蟲。\n牧獸悶著頭吃草，羽獸蹦蹦跳跳，偶爾伸直脖頸，發出幾聲愉悅婉轉的鳴聲。\n小滿橫起自己的笛子，放到嘴邊。\n風輕輕地伴奏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"山青青呀水悠悠，月光灑在河上慢慢流♪\n小船小船搖又晃，我種下種子等花放♪\n星星掛在天空不說話，外面飄來的種子發芽啦♪\n你坐上小船去遠方，稻花兒飄飄落手旁♪\n飄呀，飄呀，我送你去遠方♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不錯的報酬，我很喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這顆石頭是你的了，你的願望會實現的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小滿","speakerId":"avg_4122_grabds_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小滿放下笛子，瞪了旁邊的小禾一眼，跺跺腳跑走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘看起來在生氣啊，這是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這首曲子是她給我編的，三年前她送我去考校的時候吹給我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我記得的，只是剛剛沒反應過來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，有這份心意，倒是難得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你有沒有什麼想要跟我買的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝您，但我現在沒有什麼特別想要的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說我想要的，也不可能靠買來得到，還是需要我自己去做才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不妨說來聽聽？在下也別無所長，只是去過的地方格外多，能賣的東西也格外多些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼都能賣，那你難道能賣我一個能餵飽天下人的未來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是……什麼意思……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貨物越精貴要價當然也越高，你的宏偉理想，你打算用什麼價錢來買呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"禾生","speakerId":"avg_4119_wanqin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小禾，剩下那些污染的莊稼我已經收拾了，你看還需要我做──"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣著華麗的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位先生為何這麼盯著我？難道是與在下認識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借一步說話！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
